OL,3,GNEWSAGrassroots arts venue reopens
OL,4,Aafter closure fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA groundswell of local support has led
OL,7,Fto a music venue reopening, its owner
OL,8,Fhas said.
OL,10,FThere were fears in March that the
OL,11,FHunter Club in Bury St Edmunds,
OL,12,FSuffolk, could close down after its
OL,13,Flong-time manager left.
OL,15,FHowever, there was an outcry from
OL,16,Fmusicians and after almost four months,
OL,17,Fthe grassroots music centre reopened in
OL,18,FAugust - and it has been hosting a
OL,19,Fweekend of live performances to mark
OL,20,Fits comeback.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
